  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　ツノで　あいての　きもちを\nかんじとる。　オスは　じゅうしゃの\nように　あるじのそばで　せわをやく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리에 달린 뿔로 상대의 기분을\n감지한다. 수컷은 집사처럼\n주인의 곁에서 시중을 든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用頭上的角讀取對方的心情。\n雄性就像管家一樣，\n在主人的身邊打理一切。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut sentir les émotions d’autrui avec ses cornes.\nLe mâle reste aux côtés de son Dresseur pour\ns’occuper de lui, à l’image d’un domestique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit den Hörnern auf seinem Kopf erfasst es die\nGefühle seines Gegenübers. Männchen kümmern\nsich wie Bedienstete um ihren Trainer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe las emociones del objetivo con los\ncuernos de la cabeza. Los machos están atentos\na cualquier cosa que necesite su Entrenador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le corna sulla testa gli permettono di percepire\nlo stato d’animo degli altri. Il maschio segue il\nsuo Allenatore ovunque e si prende cura di lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses the horns on its head to sense the\nemotions of others. Males will act as valets for\nthose they serve, looking after their every need.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　ツノで　相手の　気持ちを\n感じとる。　オスは　従者の\nように　主のそばで　世話を焼く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用头上的角读取对方的心情。\n雄性就像管家一样，\n在主人的身边打理一切。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe las emociones del objetivo con los\ncuernos de la cabeza. Los machos están atentos\na cualquier cosa que necesite su Entrenador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノで　ちかくの　いきものの\nきもちを　かんじとる。　ポジティブな\nかんじょうが　ちからの　みなもと。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뿔로 가까이 있는 생명체의\n기분을 읽는다. 긍정적인\n감정이 힘의 원천이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能透過自己的角去\n感受附近生物的情感。\n正面情緒是牠的能量之源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec ses cornes, il peut percevoir les émotions\ndes êtres vivants alentour. Celles qui sont\npositives lui servent de source d’énergie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinen Hörnern erfasst es die Gefühle von\nLebewesen, die sich in seiner Nähe aufhalten.\nPositive Gefühle sind die Quelle seiner Kraft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con sus cuernos percibe las emociones de los\nseres vivos que se hallen cerca. Los sentimientos\npositivos constituyen su fuente de energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percepisce lo stato d’animo di chi gli sta intorno\ngrazie alle sue corna. I sentimenti positivi sono\nla sua fonte di energia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Through its horns, it can pick up on the emotions\nof creatures around it. Positive emotions are the\nsource of its strength.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノで　近くの　生き物の\n気持ちを　感じとる。　ポジティブな\n感情が　力の　源。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
